# Response headers for v6.2. GitHub Pages IGNORES this file: it cannot set
# headers at all. This works as-is on Cloudflare Pages or Netlify, or as
# Transform Rules if Cloudflare is put in front of GitHub Pages.
# The page's own meta CSP still applies; browsers enforce both.
/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=(), browsing-topics=()
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
